  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fmakeship\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/web/slabfish_plush.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/banner/gallery.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fblueprint\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"蓝图\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/blueprint\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"网站\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/website\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/discord\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fx\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"X\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/x\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fpatreon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Patreon\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/patreon\"></a>\n</p><h3>📖 关于：</h3><p>画廊是一个小型模组，为画作引入了多项生活质量优化功能！包括以下内容：</p><ul>\n<li>画作物品现在会根据其所代表的画作显示图标纹理</li>\n<li>手持画作物品时右键单击，可以通过GUI搜索并选择画作变体</li>\n<li>现在可以使用剪刀或精准采集附魔对已放置的画作进行采集，将其作为独立物品收集</li>\n<li>来自棘巧试炼更新的画作变体已被移植到1.20.1版本</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/web/divider.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fblueprint\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/blueprint.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fabnormals_delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/abnormals_delight.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fallurement\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/allurement.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fatmospheric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/atmospheric.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fautumnity\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/autumnity.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fberry_good\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/berry_good.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fboatload\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/boatload.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fbuzzier_bees\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/buzzier_bees.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fcaverns_and_chasms\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/caverns_and_chasms.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fclayworks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/clayworks.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fendergetic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/endergetic.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fenvironmental\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/environmental.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fgallery\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/gallery.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fslabfi.sh%252fcf%252fincubation\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https:/